# English in code, Russian in UI

## Code (always English)

- File and folder names: `CatalogController`, `catalog/marks/index.tsx`
- URLs and route names: `/catalog/marks/create`, `catalog.marks.store`
- PHP classes, methods, variables, DB tables/columns: `AutoMark`, `auto_marks`, `store()`, `mark_id`
- TypeScript types, props, hooks: English identifiers
- Permission slugs: `catalog.view`, `catalog.manage`

## UI (Russian only)

- Button labels, headings, descriptions, table column titles shown to admin
- Flash messages, validation messages for users
- Breadcrumb **titles** (display text), not `href` paths
- `APP_LOCALE=ru`, lang files in `lang/ru/`

## Do not

- Use translit in routes, controllers, or file paths (`katalog`, `Avtomarka`, `sozdanie`)
- Use English in user-visible labels unless it's a proper name (BMW, URL slug field label may say "URL")
